---
// Two or three figures side by side, stacking on narrow screens.
---

<div class="fig-row"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .fig-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(16rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0 16px;
    margin: 1.8em 0;
  }
  .fig-row > :global(.fig) {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
</style>
